<title>NETHERLANDS: NWE oil products - fuel dips, others quiet.</title>
<headline>NWE oil products - fuel dips, others quiet.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>ARA fuel oil barges opened softer on Monday while other products were barely talked in early trade with the IPE futures market closed, traders said.</p>
<p>High sulphur fuel oil barge offers dipped by $1 a tonne to $83 fob Rotterdam. Bids were down to $80/$81 fob.</p>
<p>Traders said the market had been supported on Friday by a single major which was showing no interest on Monday.</p>
<p>Heating oil barges were unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom, +31 20 504 5004</p>
</text>
